  "story": {
    "title": "Forever Friendship",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Once upon a time there was a parrot. His name was Roxy. He was very open minded.",
      "One day Roxy met with an owl. His name was Roza. He was also very like minded.",
      "Thy sat on a tree and started gossiping. They liked each other. After a while they became good friends.",
      "After few months one day they misunderstood each other. They left the place and didn't meet for a long time.",
      "Got to know that a butterfly thought an idea. He went to Roza and told about Roxy's false illness.",
      "The same story about Roza was uttered by the butterfly to Roxy.",
      "Very soon they met on that tree where their friendship started from.",
      "After a moment they forgot all their misunderstandings and issues and again became forever friends.",
      "Now the story of their friendship is popular in the whole animal world."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Once upon a time there was a parrot.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ngày xửa ngày xưa, có một chú vẹt."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "His name was Roxy.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tên chú là Roxy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He was very open minded.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chú ấy rất cởi mở."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day Roxy met with an owl.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, Roxy gặp một chú cú."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "His name was Roza.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tên chú cú là Roza."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He was also very like minded.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chú ấy cũng rất hợp tính."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Thy sat on a tree and started gossiping.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn ấy ngồi trên cây và bắt đầu trò chuyện."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They liked each other.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn ấy rất thích nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After a while they became good friends.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau một lúc, họ trở thành bạn tốt của nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After few months one day they misunderstood each other.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vài tháng sau, một ngày nọ, hai bạn ấy hiểu lầm nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They left the place and didn't meet for a long time.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Họ rời đi và không gặp nhau trong một thời gian dài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Got to know that a butterfly thought an idea.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một chú bướm đã nghĩ ra một ý hay."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He went to Roza and told about Roxy's false illness.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chú bướm đến gặp Roza và kể về bệnh giả của Roxy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The same story about Roza was uttered by the butterfly to Roxy.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chú bướm cũng kể câu chuyện tương tự về Roza cho Roxy nghe."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Very soon they met on that tree where their friendship started from.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Rất nhanh sau đó, họ gặp lại nhau trên cái cây nơi tình bạn của họ bắt đầu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After a moment they forgot all their misunderstandings and issues and again became forever friends.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau một lúc, họ quên hết mọi hiểu lầm và vấn đề, rồi lại trở thành bạn thân mãi mãi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Now the story of their friendship is popular in the whole animal world.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_106814/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Giờ đây, câu chuyện tình bạn của họ nổi tiếng khắp thế giới động vật."
      }
    ]
  },
